	(text "DMA: DMAB or BE low releases the bus. GAL B2 (U83) synchronises the request to the end of PHI2,\nso the CPU clock gate and buffer enables only change while PHI2 is low. Cards drive the bus after that edge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.146 127.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "08a3e46c-da8b-44f6-aebd-97c896d12057")
	)
	(text "SERIAL CLOCK: Y2 1.8432 MHz Pierce oscillator (U75) -> SER_CLK_SRC -> U34 buffer -> SER_CLK (ACIA);\n  R24 33R -> slot pin 15 (SER_CLK_BUS).\nBUS CLOCK: Y1 14.31818 MHz on U75 -> U34 squares it -> HS_CLK_SRC -> U88 bus clock generator;\n  R9 33R -> slot HS_CLK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.146 112.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c28171f7-886f-43c8-9731-bd1c01add5c0")
	)
	(text "SOFT POWER (J37): 1-2 momentary case button on J7-11/9 toggles the PSU; 2-3 latching switch drives PS_ON# directly.\nU78/U79 run from +5V standby; C112/R20 clear the latch at mains power-up (PSU stays off)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.146 142.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e5dcb52e-4c61-4ee6-8006-93b6d27273d1")
	)
	(text "AUDIO: line-level, AC coupled (C103/C104), 47k bleeders. GNDA joins GND only at R18: place R18 next to U58.\nDecoupling: C105 at U57, C106 at U58, C107-C110 at U59."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.146 157.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ebc23409-4e95-439b-a0ae-d58659f5cf0e")
	)
	(text "Z REGISTER ($FFF4) buffer enabled on reads only (nZREG_RD).  -5V for slot pin 9 from U80 (79L05)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.654 196.596 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f5f6f2a5-bf3d-4f6f-94e1-059a9a95242c")
	)
